{%- comment -%}
  Proof band: one full-bleed photograph, one short voice line in
  Prata, and the USP trio (snippets/usp-trio.liquid — shared with the PDP so
  one edit lands everywhere) with its thin line icons. Static text, no
  badges, no counters. Copy is GMC-safe fact only (shipping window, dispatch
  window, payment security).

  Below that: fit/fabric benefit blocks. The reference standard is FIT facts,
  not marketing filler — "flattering silhouette",
  "breathable", never a fibre name we have not confirmed with the supplier
  (standing rule: fabric lines are feel/look, never material). Editable
  blocks so an honest fibre claim never has to wait for a code change. Ink
  checkmarks — house rule reserves colour for sale-red / money-back-green,
  and a fit fact is neither.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="home-proof bleed reveal">
  {%- comment -%} The atmosphere shot can be replaced by a model wearing a
  catalog piece — the asset filename wins when set (landscape model shot
  shipped as a theme asset). {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if section.settings.asset_image != blank -%}
    <img src="{{ section.settings.asset_image | asset_url }}" sizes="100vw" width="1536" height="1024" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  {%- elsif section.settings.image != blank -%}
    <img
      class="home-proof__art"
      src="{{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 900 }}"
      srcset="{{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 560 }} 560w, {{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w, {{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 1400 }} 1400w"
      sizes="100vw"
      width="{{ section.settings.image.width }}" height="{{ section.settings.image.height }}"
      alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  {%- endif -%}
  <div class="wrap home-proof__body">
    {%- liquid
      comment
        Merchant copy wins in every language; the old reassign on non-primary
        locales replaced it with the theme's defaults. These are shipping and
        returns claims, so printing theme copy over a merchant's own wording was
        also the riskiest version of this bug — the store would be advertising
        terms it never wrote. Every field is guarded (usp-trio drops blank
        slots), so blank stays blank instead of falling back.
      endcomment
      assign pf_voice = section.settings.voice
      assign pf_1 = section.settings.usp_1
      assign pf_2 = section.settings.usp_2
      assign pf_3 = section.settings.usp_3
    -%}
    {%- if pf_voice != blank -%}
      <p class="dl home-proof__voice">{{ pf_voice | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- render 'usp-trio', one: pf_1, two: pf_2, three: pf_3 -%}
    {%- comment -%} The two fit/fabric benefit lines shipped by default were
    removed: sitting directly under the USP trio at the very bottom of the
    homepage, they repeated its register. The BLOCK TYPE stays: adding a "Benefit line" block in
    the Theme Editor brings the list straight back, and the preset simply no
    longer ships with two of them. {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
      <ul class="proof-fit bt" aria-label="{{ 'home.proof.fit_aria' | t }}">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
            <li class="proof-fit__item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <span class="proof-fit__ico" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'icon', name: 'check', size: 16 %}</span>
              <span>{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</span>
            </li>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Proof band",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Image", "info": "Shopify Files: brand-proof.webp (landscape 3:2)." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "asset_image", "label": "Or: theme-asset filename (wins)", "info": "e.g. my-image.webp — landscape model shot." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "voice", "label": "Voice line", "default": "Picked with care. Worn on repeat." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "usp_1", "label": "USP 1", "default": "Free shipping" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "usp_2", "label": "USP 2", "default": "Ships within 1–3 business days" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "usp_3", "label": "USP 3", "default": "Secure payment" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "benefit",
      "name": "Fit / fabric benefit",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "text", "label": "Benefit line", "info": "Fit fact, not marketing filler. Fabric lines: feel/look only, never a fibre name the supplier has not confirmed." }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Proof band",
      "settings": { "image": "", "voice": "Picked with care. Worn on repeat." },
      "blocks": []
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
